  "description": "Offline-first time-series buffer for .NET IoT edge devices.\n      Guarantees ordered message delivery to the cloud despite connectivity\n      interruptions — using sequence numbers rather than timestamps to\n      eliminate clock-drift ordering errors. Includes disk persistence\n      for survival across process restarts.\n\n      Designed for enterprise IoT deployments in regulated industries\n      where data loss has compliance or operational consequences.",
